# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OcarinaCTRComposer — published: source + docs only.
# The .3gx and the ready-to-install SD payload ship as a GitHub Release, not in-tree.
# Everything listed below is excluded from the repo.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Build artifacts
RawPlugin/build/
*.o
*.elf
*.3gx

# Ready-to-install SD payload (.3gx + guides + lang) -> GitHub Release, not the tree
CTRComposer/

# Source art: mostly third-party/ripped sheets, and already baked into the source headers
# (sprites.h, kbkeys.h, logo.h, topbg.h, botbg.h). Not redistributed loose.
Assets/

# Belongs to the separate CTRComposer engine repo
CTRComposer-Blank-Template.md
CTRComposer-Repo-Kickoff.md

# Wiki source — push to the OcarinaCTRComposer.wiki.git repo instead (see wiki/_HOW-TO-PUBLISH.md),
# not part of the main repo tree
wiki/

# Dev-only material — not for publishing
Gen6-Port-Feasibility.md
references/
SaveGames/
GameGuide/
dumps/

# Demo video working files — the finished .mp4 is a GitHub Release asset (75 MB), never in-tree
video/

# NOTE: site/ is deliberately NOT ignored. It holds the source of the project page and is versioned
# here; the deployed copy lives on the orphan `gh-pages` branch. See site/README.md.
